WEBVTT

00:16:28.792 --> 00:16:30.851
Tunapoanza kusoma,

00:16:30.875 --> 00:16:32.958
tunaanza kupata maneno.

00:16:33.958 --> 00:16:38.601
Na alipata maneno ya kutafakari
wao wawili wakiwa pamoja.

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:40.333
Alipata maneno

00:16:41.958 --> 00:16:44.208
ya kumwelezea ni namna gani anampenda.

00:16:46.042 --> 00:16:49.976
Kusoma pia kulibadilisha
mahusiano baina yetu.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.059
Kunatupa nyakati za kuwa karibu,

00:16:52.083 --> 00:16:54.976
kuweza kuona zaidi ya mitazamo yetu.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.684
Na kusoma kulichukua mahusiano ya
kutokuwa sawa

00:16:57.708 --> 00:17:00.375
na kulitupa usawa wa muda mfupi.